Includes the five images used in the first training phase (prior to the exposure phase).
These images are presented to the participant sequentially.
Each image is accompanied by a question that elicits a judgement from the participant on a specific characteristic of the image. 
For example, with a picture of a blue car, the question might be "do you think this car is yellow?"

For the script that accompanies this trial, including the questions posed, please refer to the "Script" document provided in the Training_Phase_1 directory.
